	(text "Barrel input, 12-24 V centre positive (spec 3.1).\nLM74502 + back-to-back N-FETs: a reversed plug or anything above ~28 V (27.9 V nominal, 26.0-29.7 V over tolerance)\nsimply leaves V_INPUT off. F1 5 A hold PTC; bidirectional TVS for transients. Check J13 pin 1 = centre on the first board."
